    "sensesNotes": "Darkvision 120 ft, Devil's Sight, Truesight 30 ft",
    "tactics": "Bone Devils are commanders and negotiators — they spend the first round assessing before fully committing. Fear Aura keeps weaker enemies at a distance while they focus on primary threats. A Bone Devil that has agreed to terms will execute those terms with precision and will always point out when you could have asked for more.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Claw [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 10 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 14 damage (9 + 5 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 14 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tail Sting [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 10 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 13 damage (8 + 5 Str) + Fortitude [Easy] save or Poisoned (Strong).</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 13 damage, DR halved (round up) + Poisoned (Strong) (no save) + Weakened condition for 1 minute.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Fear Aura: Creatures within 10 feet that are not Fiends make a Will [Easy] save at the start of their turn. On failure, they gain the Frightened condition until they succeed. Creatures immune to fear or charm are unaffected. Wall of Ice (1/day): As 2 [Combat] actions, create a 60-foot-long, 20-foot-high wall of ice. Each section has HP 20 and DR 4. Duration until destroyed.</p>",
